      "publicNotes": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>A huge black dragon with horns that sweep forward, acid dripping from her jaws and hissing where it lands. A long, pale scar runs along her flank. Her eyes are bright green and narrowed with hatred.</p>",
